{"ID":"20240515131455-97szpa1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131455-97szpa1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131455-97szpa1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132305-zrecnsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132305-zrecnsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132305-zrecnsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:664,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:664\u0026#125;","title":"004","type":"doc","updated":"20240515144823"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515132305-zrecnsi","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 892px;","id":"20240515132305-zrecnsi","updated":"20240515144823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/19"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"BM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"62歲，中等身材，略胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二個月前因說話不清、身腫、四肢無力，被西醫診斷為ALS ( amyotrophic lateral sclerosis；俗稱漸凍人)，故來師處就診。此女自1988年迄今長期服用降血壓藥Diovan，不服藥時血壓140/92mmHg，服藥時120/80mmHg。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠：因頻尿無法睡通宵。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口：過好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"便秘：一星期一次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：淡黃便秘時腹痛：無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：無，但理智上會提醒自己喝水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒熱：睡時無寒熱，手足溫額涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其他：時身瞤動(肌肉跳動)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區黃點、心包區有黃塊、腎區反應不好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下焦寒實。上焦假熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢、細辛二錢、大黃四錢、烏藥四錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉五錢、茯苓五錢、熟地三錢、補骨脂三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢、丹皮三錢、白术三錢、豬苓三錢、桂枝五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢、鬱金五錢、黃芩三錢、龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每付九碗水煮成三碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1便秘不覺腹痛，屬下焦寒實，用大黃附子細辛湯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2不吃降血壓藥時140/92，師曰可停藥。且吃降壓藥控制也不能保證不中風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3此高血壓成因是腎陽不足，因下焦寒，血管收縮，無法有效率排出身體多餘的水份，對管壁的壓力回逆，故高血壓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4腎陽不足用補骨脂、熟地、澤瀉補腎，炮附子亦補腎。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5雖然此女不口渴，但脈仍有力，手足不寒，仍不到用生附的條件。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6肌肉瞤動是皮下有多餘的水，用五苓散利水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7眼中肝區有黃點表肝中有毒素，用柴胡、鬱金、黃芩、龍膽草清肝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8川芎、丹皮可活血化瘀，促進血管彈性。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}